What:		/sys/devices/virtual/misc/mshv_vtl_low/vtl0_transitions/cpu<N>
Date:		July 2026
Contact:	linux-hyperv@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Root-readable cumulative count of completed VTL2-to-VTL0
		transitions on CPU <N>. The value is a decimal counter followed
		by a newline.

		The counter is best-effort diagnostic telemetry and may change
		while it is being read. Files are created for possible CPUs, so
		offline CPUs remain represented and retain their last value.
Users:		VTL diagnostic and performance tooling
